# 公司 Windows 與家裡 macOS 共用：一律存 LF，只有 Windows 專用腳本用 CRLF
# 避免兩台互推時出現「整個檔案都改了」但其實只有行尾不同
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二進位檔不做任何轉換
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
